    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The project budget, our company's can propose a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure to optimize costs while ensuring the expected quality of service. a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure to optimize costs while ensuring the expected quality of service allows for flexibility and adaptability throughout the project lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To control annual operating costs, our company's can leverage our company's experience in working with regulated, document-intensive organizations, such as our company's past reference with a regional council, where our company's successfully implemented an assistant supporting social-services case workers. our company's will prioritize the delivery of our company's flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from the client's own documents. our company's dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work closely with the client to ensure a phased implementation that meets the client specific needs. our company's will also provide change-management support and training resources during the deployment phase to minimize disruption to the client operations and ensure a smooth transition." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of cost optimization, our company's partnership with OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider, will enable our company's to offer hosting solutions that meet the client's requirements while controlling costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's integration partner, Ligeo Conseil, will help our company's connect our flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from the client's own documents to the client business production tools, ensuring seamless integration and minimizing additional costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Throughout the project, our company's will maintain a joint steering committee and operational committee to ensure effective governance and communication. our company's single accountable project director will serve as the primary point of contact for the client, and our company's will have a documented escalation path in place to address any issues that may arise." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine and the tax code (CGI), the commercial code and applicable legal texts, collective-bargaining agreements for payroll/social, and Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company's expertise, past references, and partnerships, our company's are confident that our company's can deliver a high-quality solution that meets the client's requirements while optimizing costs and ensuring a successful deployment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent, with a high level of availability during business hours and resilience to seasonal peak loads." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

