    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, can meet The client hosting requirements by utilizing our Sovereign tier hosting option, which is provided by OuraneCloud and is SecNumCloud-qualified. our Sovereign tier hosting option, which is provided by OuraneCloud and is SecNumCloud-qualified is EU-only, renewable-powered, and ensures a high level of availability during business hours." ;
