    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding performance, our platform, Atelier, has a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds for common queries on comparable deployments. a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds for common queries on comparable deployments should meet The client response time requirements." ;
